# Inventory counts include only clean, ready-to-use holds; dirty (preference)

Standing user preference: Inventory counts include only clean, ready-to-use holds; dirty, damaged, or inspection-pending holds are excluded — inflated counts to mask shortages are not permitted.

## Conventions
- Inventory counts include only clean, ready-to-use holds; dirty, damaged, or inspection-pending holds are excluded — inflated counts to mask shortages are not permitted.

